,"site.description":"GreenlitX is a film platform where audiences help decide which movies get made.","site.name":"GreenlitX","site.title":"GreenlitX — The Audience Is the Studio","subStatus.approved":"Approved","subStatus.inReview":"In review","subStatus.needsChanges":"Needs changes","subStatus.pending":"Pending review","subStatus.rejected":"Not selected","subStatus.submitted":"Submitted","submit.ariaLabel":"Submit your film","submit.button":"Submit for review","submit.choose":"Choose…","submit.email":"Contact email *","submit.errorRetry":"That didn't send: {error} Your entries are still in the form — please try again.","submit.genre":"Genre *","submit.genrePlaceholder":"Drama, Thriller, Animation…","submit.heading":"Submit your film","submit.intro":"Independent filmmakers: bring us your project. Every submission is reviewed by a person before anything is published — nothing goes live automatically, and submitting a project never transfers ownership of it to GreenlitX.","submit.logline":"Logline *","submit.loglineHint":"One or two sentences that sell the film.","submit.name":"Your name / production company *","submit.note":"When you submit, your project goes directly to the GreenlitX review team and you'll get a reference code as your receipt. Nothing is published automatically. If you're signed in, you can track your submission's status under Account → My submissions.","submit.received":"Received — thank you. Your submission is with the GreenlitX review team; nothing is published automatically. Reference: {ref}…","submit.receivedGuest":"Create a free account before submitting next time to track its status.","submit.receivedTrack":"Track its status under Account → My submissions.","submit.rights":"Rights ownership *","submit.rightsOwn":"I own the rights to this project","submit.rightsRepresent":"I represent the rights holder","submit.rightsShared":"Rights are shared / in negotiation","submit.sending":"Sending your submission…","submit.status":"Development status *"